   <media:title>Expedition with Burberry: Shangri-La</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/5gJPKZ-G47E?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/5gJPKZ-G47E/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Created in partnership with Chinese National Geography Magazine, the second chapter of Burberry’s three-part documentary journeys deep into Shangri-La in Yunnan Province, China.

Join actors Janice Han and Elvis Man, alongside conservationist Peng Jiansheng of the Shangri-La Alpine Botanical Garden, as they explore snow-capped peaks, alpine lakes and ancient forests, revealing the remarkable ecosystems that thrive at high altitudes.

Celebrating Burberry’s 170th anniversary, the documentary reflects the house’s enduring affinity with the outdoors. Each chapter follows special guests in signature Burberry outerwear as they venture through some of China’s most extraordinary landscapes.</media:description>
