   <media:title>Expedition with Burberry: Xi’an and the Qinling Mountains</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/HMy9n2fdaMo?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/HMy9n2fdaMo/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Created in partnership with Chinese National Geography magazine, the first episode of Burberry’s three-part documentary series uncovers the secrets of Xi’an and the Qinling Mountains. 

Join brand ambassador Chen Kun as he explores Tang Dynasty landmarks and experiences national cultural heritage, guided by Li Shuanke and Zhang Chenliang of Chinese National Geography magazine. The team then travels from the Hanzhong Tiankeng at the mountains’ southern base towards the central range.

Celebrating Burberry’s 170th anniversary, the series reflects the house’s long-standing affinity for the outdoors. Each episode features special guests in signature Burberry outerwear, exploring some of China’s most spectacular landscapes.

Discover Burberry: https://brby.co/V1BF7Q</media:description>
